WEBVTT

04:01.858 --> 04:03.108
See you later, Woody.

04:11.242 --> 04:14.244
Pull my string!
The birthday party?'s today?

04:16.122 --> 04:17.247
Okay, everybody,

04:17.540 --> 04:18.707
coast is clear!

04:26.466 --> 04:28.425
Ages 3 and up. It's on my box.

04:28.510 --> 04:32.429
Ages 3 and up. I'm not supposed
to be baby-sitting Princess Drool.
